      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "就这样，小林历奇毅然决然地\n回到了赛场的观众席──",
      "source_fingerprint": "6e010f1aa04cb6156bf38c80e6269c80ba6105f5c150f47d5eccc1290077512f",
